ur, Cave, Lab, Ice and Shop. Im monkey Camp there are also different Gamemodes like Sandbox, Horror and Kickout Fight.\n\nMonkey Camp has Multiplayer and Voice Chat so you can speak with the other players.\n\nPlay Monkey Camp Now with or without your friends.", "short_description": "Monkey Camp is a fun Gorilla tag fan Game with many different Maps and Gamemodes and an alwesome Community."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.freeprivacypolicy.com/live/55d462fa-2168-4e10-a40f-16fb7ce87ca1", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "132magnet", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://132magnet.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "25043445895300785"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974678_224708823799215_4790133031985241816_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pYd9_7W0T0YQ7kNvwENNl8J&_nc_oc=AdoJiPf7iu4gJK5iyiZsAyhBz5tP2DasMMZ0viOmlvgOTUueCYAdqP2IzUa-kaen2hc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-e5m_bauEsUX5mek5auRwdjqtLhWgr8hYWWOGehZfl2g&oe=6A3A9A8A"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Monkey Camp", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topic